WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.628
The king scratched his belly.

2
00:00:09.629 --> 00:00:14.114
"Something's making me itch!" he said.

3
00:00:14.115 --> 00:00:16.553
The queen looked up from her book.

4
00:00:16.554 --> 00:00:21.945
"Take a bath," she said.

5
00:00:21.946 --> 00:00:25.044
The queen scratched her arm.

6
00:00:25.045 --> 00:00:28.790
"I'm itchy too," Prince Eric said.

7
00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:32.528
He scratched and then peeked down his shirt.

8
00:00:32.529 --> 00:00:35.570
"Ack! I see bugs!"

9
00:00:35.571 --> 00:00:38.931
"Bugs?" Princess Mary cried.

10
00:00:38.932 --> 00:00:41.596
She tried to scratch her back.

11
00:00:41.597 --> 00:00:44.646
"Tom!" the princess cried.

12
00:00:44.647 --> 00:00:49.184
"Make the bugs go away!"

13
00:00:49.185 --> 00:00:51.379
Tom lifted his wand.

14
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.158
He looked worried.

15
00:00:53.159 --> 00:00:56.319
"What kind of bugs?" he asked.

16
00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.492
"I can't see them."

17
00:00:59.493 --> 00:01:01.843
The queen looked at the princess.

18
00:01:01.844 --> 00:01:10.616
"You have fleas!" she cried.

19
00:01:10.617 --> 00:01:14.721
Everybody but Tom was scratching.

20
00:01:14.722 --> 00:01:18.252
Cat hissed at Tom.

21
00:01:18.253 --> 00:01:21.221
"I don't want fleas!" she said.

22
00:01:21.222 --> 00:01:23.156
"Let's get out of here!"

23
00:01:23.157 --> 00:01:25.554
Tom looked at Princess Mary.

24
00:01:25.555 --> 00:01:29.505
She was still scratching flea bites.

25
00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:33.007
"Cat, you can go to our room," he said.

26
00:01:33.008 --> 00:01:34.672
"I'll stay and help."

27
00:01:34.673 --> 00:01:37.714
Cat sighed.

28
00:01:37.715 --> 00:01:40.216
"You have a kind heart, Tom."

29
00:01:40.217 --> 00:01:43.755
She hid deep in his pocket.

30
00:01:43.756 --> 00:01:47.297
"Where did the fleas come from?" Tom asked.

31
00:01:47.298 --> 00:01:49.232
He waved his wand.

32
00:01:49.233 --> 00:01:51.118
"I'll send them back."

33
00:01:51.119 --> 00:01:54.210
"It's your fault!" Dirk yelled.

34
00:01:54.211 --> 00:01:56.713
Dirk pointed at Tom's pocket.

35
00:01:56.714 --> 00:01:59.428
"Fleas come from animals.

36
00:01:59.429 --> 00:02:02.681
Your cat brought fleas to the castle!

37
00:02:02.682 --> 00:02:08.720
She must go!"

